    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0ba5bc9a3ec24cfc8d87d04ef32cdf8f",
      "statement": "Concurrency is capped by a private const MaxConcurrentJobs = 10 passed as ParallelOptions.MaxDegreeOfParallelism to Parallel.ForEachAsync over _channel.Reader.ReadAllAsync(stoppingToken); because it is a const and SebastianConfig has no queue section, the cap can only be changed in code, and it bounds concurrent agent runs and concurrent worktrees process-wide.",
